      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "xiaoshu-c2",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "小暑是第十一个节气。太阳到达黄经105°，炎热加剧但未到顶点。",
        "en": "Xiaoshu is the eleventh term: the Sun reaches 105°. Heat builds but hasn't peaked."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；气候经验因纬度而异"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文学口径；2017年起有国家标准表述",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-xinhua-xiaoshu-2022",
        "source-forestry-xiaoshu-2026"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-xiaoshu-longitude-105"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "xiaoshu-c3",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "小暑是农历六月的\"节\"。\"三伏天\"即将开始。",
        "en": "Xiaoshu is the node term of the sixth lunar month. The \"three fu\" hottest days approach."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国（干支纪日传统；入伏日期全国同一历法日）"
      ],
      "period": "机制为古代历法传统；表述为现代天文科普口径（2024）",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-xinhua-sanfu-2024",
        "source-gujintushu-suigong-furi"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-xiaoshu-sanfu-gengday-mechanism"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "xiaoshu-c4",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "越来越热。温风来了，蟋蟀躲到墙根，鹰开始学习飞行。",
        "en": "It gets hotter. Warm winds arrive, crickets move to walls, young hawks learn to fly."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国（气温概述以南方为限；雷暴表述限南方大部分地区）"
      ],
      "period": "当代气候概述（2021-2026机构稿口径）",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-forestry-xiaoshu-2026",
        "source-ihchina-xiaoshu-feature"
