    {
      "id": "xiaoshu-c7",
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "小暑是炎热积累的阶段，大暑还在后面。",
        "en": "Xiaoshu is heat building toward its peak — the greatest intensity is yet to come."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国（起源记事锚定秦地雍城；解释传统为汉代以降文献所承）"
      ],
